    A.&lt;/span&gt;,&amp;#32;
  &lt;span itemprop=&#34;author&#34; itemscope itemtype=&#34;https://schema.org/Person&#34;&gt;&lt;span itemprop=&#34;familyName&#34;&gt;Narasimhan&lt;/span&gt;,&amp;#32;
    &lt;meta itemprop=&#34;givenName&#34; content=&#34;Karthik&#34; /&gt;
    K.&lt;/span&gt;,&amp;#32;
  &lt;span itemprop=&#34;author&#34; itemscope itemtype=&#34;https://schema.org/Person&#34;&gt;&lt;span itemprop=&#34;familyName&#34;&gt;Salimans&lt;/span&gt;,&amp;#32;
    &lt;meta itemprop=&#34;givenName&#34; content=&#34;Tim&#34; /&gt;
    T.&lt;/span&gt;,&amp;#32;
  &lt;span itemprop=&#34;author&#34; itemscope itemtype=&#34;https://schema.org/Person&#34;&gt;&lt;span itemprop=&#34;familyName&#34;&gt;Sutskever&lt;/span&gt;,&amp;#32;
    &lt;meta itemprop=&#34;givenName&#34; content=&#34;Ilya&#34; /&gt;
    I.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;#32;&amp;amp;&amp;#32;&lt;span itemprop=&#34;author&#34; itemscope itemtype=&#34;https://schema.org/Person&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
  &amp;#32;
    (&lt;span itemprop=&#34;datePublished&#34;&gt;2018&lt;/span&gt;).
  &amp;#32;&lt;span itemprop=&#34;name&#34;&gt;Improving language understanding by generative pre-training&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;




&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
 was trained to output a probability distribution over the next token given the input context. The following likelihood objective is maximized on a corpus of training tokens $\{u_1,\ldots,u_n\}$ via stochastic gradient descent:
$$
L(\theta) = \sum_{i}\log \mathbb{P}_\theta(u_i \mid u_{i-k}\cdots u_{i-1})
$$&lt;/p&gt;</description>
